	(gr_text "Remember to select a 7MHz clock!\nA500 REV3 or REV5 select CPLD\nA500 REV6 select A500 and close JP6\nA500+ select A500\n\nIf you're using an A500 accelerator \nin the CO-PROCESSOR slot, you must\nremove the A500s CPU or E will clash!\n\nIf you've got an expansion inside\nyour A500 on the auto-config chain\nconnect it's config out to CFGIN\n\nOnly fit U11 if you need the 28mhz\nclock at the COPROCESSOR\n"
